    <section class="faq" id="faq">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Is this yoga teacher training Yoga Alliance certified?</h3>
                <p>Yes. Upon completion you will receive a <strong>Yoga Alliance RYT200 certification</strong>, recognised worldwide. Our 200-hour program meets all Yoga Alliance standards for contact hours, curriculum, and assessment. <a href="/blog/yoga-alliance-certification">Learn more about RYT200 certification</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Where exactly is the training located in Lagos?</h3>
                <p>Heat Lagos is located at <strong>Edificio da Fabrica da Ribeira, Av. dos Descobrimentos, Loja G, 8600-854 Lagos, Portugal</strong> — directly across from <strong>Praia da Batata</strong> in the heart of the Algarve. Many theory sessions take place outside on the sand. <a href="/blog/lagos-travel-guide-ytt-students">See our Lagos travel guide</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>How much does yoga teacher training in Portugal cost?</h3>
                <p>Our 200-hour YTT Portugal costs <strong>€1,490 early bird</strong> (payable in 3 instalments). Total cost including accommodation and meals typically ranges €2,390-3,290 for the 15-day intensive. <a href="/blog/cost-of-yoga-teacher-training-portugal">Compare all Portugal YTT prices</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What yoga experience do I need before applying?</h3>
                <p>You need some yoga experience, but how much depends on your overall background. If you're uncertain, <a href="mailto:stine@heatlagos.com">reach out</a> and we'll have an honest conversation about whether this is the right fit for you right now.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Can I take just the online portion without the in-person intensive?</h3>
                <p>Yes — the 60-hour online Vinyasa training is available as a standalone product for <strong>€297</strong> (or €49/month × 6 months). It's the same material live participants complete before arriving in Portugal. <a href="#apply">Ask us about the online-only option</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What happens if I miss a session?</h3>
                <p>It's our intention to produce amazing teachers. To get the most out of the training and support your fellow trainees, it's important that you attend each session. You are responsible for making up any hours you miss. Talk to your trainer to set up a makeup plan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Do you offer mentorship after graduation?</h3>
                <p>Yes. It's our intention to produce amazing teachers. We offer mentorship and opportunities to teach community classes after graduation, creating a strong foundation for your teaching career. <a href="/blog/building-yoga-teaching-career">Read about building your yoga career</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

